{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/84b35d6eb1d4a33edca7e9c7842ac4d3.poster.avif?t=1766176729\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/84b35d6eb1d4a33edca7e9c7842ac4d3.webm?t=1766176729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fast-Paced and Replayable</strong>  <br>Each campaign lasts about 5 minutes, roughly the same attention span as the average voter. Perfect for quick runs, shameless retries, and unlocking upgrades you probably did not deserve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/4ab50eb836f479b9a970f92dc18b3c03.poster.avif?t=1766176729\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/4ab50eb836f479b9a970f92dc18b3c03.webm?t=1766176729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>  <br>Every turn rewrites the rules because politics is chaos and so is this game. Cards react to the situation, the situation reacts to your cards, and if everything falls apart, just merge two cards and pretend it was a strategic masterplan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/d118810598d14b0e1855f1861c946856.poster.avif?t=1766176729\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/d118810598d14b0e1855f1861c946856.webm?t=1766176729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Powerups That Carry Over</strong>  <br>Collect Campaign Buttons, hire questionably qualified Staff Members, or unleash full scale Propaganda. Whatever you hoard, plus leftover Funds, rolls into your next campaign. Fiscal responsibility not included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/50adb7d65f1ae6a6d9cdef7a20513f7b.poster.avif?t=1766176729\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/50adb7d65f1ae6a6d9cdef7a20513f7b.webm?t=1766176729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Bloc System</strong> <br>Meet voters with quirks, demands, and emotional volatility. Manage them well and they will reward you. Ignore them and your approval rating gets set on fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/5bb0cf5e106afd370dcfdb2eb6e7f698.poster.avif?t=1766176729\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/5bb0cf5e106afd370dcfdb2eb6e7f698.webm?t=1766176729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Full Controller and Steam Deck Support</strong><br>Because democracy should be playable from your couch, your desk, or while avoiding real life responsibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/1b3dd5222a1b5be2a630dc29f1bbb992.poster.avif?t=1766176729\" width=649 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/1b3dd5222a1b5be2a630dc29f1bbb992.webm?t=1766176729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980980?t=1766176729","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/f136edae7a050fc2c5db40dab576a3f011f345e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766176729","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/33f4d688f2f4c60dc7af902ac75b2972ec94ac11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766176729","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980